la ilaha illallah , la ilaha illallah<br>
yahi hai haq ka bayan la ilaha illallah<br>
jaha hussain wahan la ilaha illallah<br>
<br>
1. mohite koun-o- makan la ilaha illallah<br>
jaha hussain wahan la ilaha illallah<br>
<br>
2. khayam-e-din ka mahver sada qaton ka ami<br>
woh sajdaga ka nasha la ilaha illallah<br>
<br>
3. yaqeen ki manzil-e-awal bhi aur akhir bhi<br>
who karbala ki azaa la ilaha illallah<br>
<br>
4. kaha yeh hur ne sada sun ke subha akbar ki<br>
raha na wahm-o-guma la ilaha illallah<br>
<br>
5. zamin-e-karbobala par tha asr-e-ashura<br>
faqad dhuwa hi dhuwa la ilaha illallah<br>
<br>
6. khuda hi jaane qarar aye kaise laila ko<br>
woh maa ka dil yeh sina la ilaha illallah<br>
<br>
7. pinayi abid-e-bimar ko sitamgar ne<br>
gale mein tauq-e-gara la ilaha illallah<br>
<br>
8. hisar-e-zulm-o-sitam aur nok-e-naiza par<br>
raha hain vird-e-zuba la ilaha illallah<br>
<br>
9. raha na koi bhi baade hussain maqtal mein<br>
bus ek maa ki fugaa la ilaha illallah<br>
<br>
10. hussain sar na katate jo roz-e-ashura<br>
jaha mein rehta kaha la ilaha illallah<br>
<br>
11. farid shaam-e-ghariba hain ab bhi pesh-e-nazar<br>
woh jalta ghar woh dhoowa la ilaha illallah